title: Reformist leaders resign
new-page: true
subtitle: Reformist disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: not reformists_resign and ((spd_centrist and reformist_dissent >= 70) or (not spd_centrist and reformist_dissent >= 60))
on-arrival: {!
Q.reformist_strength *= 0.3;
Q.workers_spd -= 10;
Q.workers_other += 5;
Q.rb_strength -= 250;
Q.reformists_resign = 1;
dropAdvisors("ref", ["severing", "juchacz", "pfulf"], 1);
!}
go-to: srpd_formed

= Reformist leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the reformist faction. Many of our most experienced leaders have resigned. Most of them went to form the **Social Party of Germany**, our republican counterpart.